#T#PoiRaymarchingDataProperties
// Shared baked data for raymarching modules: the SDF volume of the mesh, and the bind pose data
// baked into its UVs. Both come out of the same bake, so the button that produces them lives here
// rather than inside any one effect.
//
// Adding a raymarching module that uses this data? See PoiRaymarchingDataFunctions below for the
// two-line contract.
//ifex _InternalWaterEnable==0
